{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gym_01",
      "hash": "2e794eb10bfeff6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我等[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好久啦！\\n未來的冠軍！\\c\\n道館館主馬志士少校是個\\n能把電屬性寶可夢\\r\\n運用自如的硬漢子！\\c\\n飛行屬性和水屬性的寶可夢\\n不好應付他呢！\\c\\n要小心不要被他弄麻痺了！\\c\\n還有，馬志士少校他非常謹慎！\\n要接近他可不容易呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gym_02",
      "hash": "2e794fb10bff011e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呼～！\\c\\n這場戰鬥真是耀眼得\\n令人頭昏眼花！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_statue_01",
      "hash": "dd9408e725ee8ef6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯葉市寶可夢道館\\n馬志士認證訓練家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_statue_02",
      "hash": "dd9407e725ee8d43",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯葉市寶可夢道館\\n馬志士認證訓練家！\\r\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]、[VAR TRNAME(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_01",
      "hash": "c6622a2b2c72f4ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "翻翻翻……！\\n裡面都是垃圾！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_02",
      "hash": "c662292b2c72f31b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "翻翻翻……！\\n哦！垃圾箱的底部\\r\\n有個開關！\\c\\n按按看吧！……我按！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_05",
      "hash": "c6622e2b2c72fb9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "電擊屏障\\n第１道鎖已被解除！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_03",
      "hash": "c662282b2c72f168",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "電擊屏障\\n第２道鎖已被解除！\\c\\n電擊屏障已被完全解除了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_04",
      "hash": "c6622f2b2c72fd4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊！電擊屏障的鎖\\n又回復原狀了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_06",
      "hash": "c6622d2b2c72f9e7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是紅色的垃圾箱！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_07",
      "hash": "c6622c2b2c72f834",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是藍色的垃圾箱！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_gomi_08",
      "hash": "c662232b2c72e8e9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這個垃圾箱的\\n開關已經被按下了。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t006gym01_max",
